Here are the domain objects:
```json
{
  "domain objects": [
    {
      "name": "Client",
      "description": "External party requesting the animation project."
    },
    {
      "name": "Project Brief",
      "description": "Initial description of the client’s project needs."
    },
    {
      "name": "Creative Producer",
      "description": "Person responsible for planning and coordinating the project."
    },
    {
      "name": "Revision Request",
      "description": "Feedback asking for changes to project work."
    },
    {
      "name": "Final Storyboard",
      "description": "Approved storyboard used for production.",
      "attributes": [
        "Storyboard Frame"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Storyboard Frame",
      "description": "A single illustrated frame within the storyboard."
    },
    {
      "name": "Project Plan",
      "description": "Structured plan of tasks, resources, and timeline."
    },
    {
      "name": "Visual Direction",
      "description": "Guidelines defining the project’s artistic style."
    },
    {
      "name": "Project Update",
      "description": "Status information sent to the client."
    },
    {
      "name": "Art Director",
      "description": "Person overseeing artistic direction and quality."
    },
    {
      "name": "Concept Artist",
      "description": "Artist creating early visual sketches for direction."
    },
    {
      "name": "Sketch",
      "description": "Initial artwork created to establish visual ideas."
    },
    {
      "name": "Storyboard Artist",
      "description": "Artist creating the storyboard from sketches."
    },
    {
      "name": "Feedback",
      "description": "Art director’s guidance for improvements."
    },
    {
      "name": "Animator",
      "description": "Artist producing animated sequences from the storyboard."
    },
    {
      "name": "Sequence",
      "description": "A produced segment of animation."
    },
    {
      "name": "Production Manager",
      "description": "Person reviewing animation work and coordinating revisions."
    },
    {
      "name": "Final Animation",
      "description": "Collection of approved sequences forming the final piece."
    },
    {
      "name": "Client Delivery",
      "description": "The package of final animation sent to the client."
    },
    {
      "name": "Quality Reviewer",
      "description": "Person conducting the final quality check."
    }
  ]
}
```
